		<title>Madonna and Prince on tour together! &#8220;The world is not ready for this&#8221;, he thought.</title>
		<link>http://drownedmadonna.com/madonna-and-prince-on-tour-together-the-world-is-not-ready-for-this-he-thought/20160421</link>
		<comments>http://drownedmadonna.com/madonna-and-prince-on-tour-together-the-world-is-not-ready-for-this-he-thought/20160421#comments</comments>
		<pubDate>Thu, 21 Apr 2016 18:56:29 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[giampiero]]></dc:creator>
				<category><![CDATA[music]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[tour]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Prince]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[The Royalty Tour]]></category>

		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://drownedmadonna.com/?p=6721</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[<p>Madonna and Prince thought to go on tour together. Madonna really liked the idea: &#8220;we can call it the Royalty [...]</p>
<p>The post <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com/madonna-and-prince-on-tour-together-the-world-is-not-ready-for-this-he-thought/20160421">Madonna and Prince on tour together! &#8220;The world is not ready for this&#8221;, he thought.</a> appeared first on <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com">Madonna news new album Rebel Heart</a>.</p>
]]></description>
				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Madonna and Prince thought to go on tour together. Madonna really liked the idea: &#8220;we can call it the Royalty Tour&#8221;. But unfortunately  Prince thought that &#8220;The world is not ready for this; it&#8217;s to big&#8221;.</p>
<p>That&#8217;s what Guy Oseary revealed today paying homage to his biggest idol, who died today at 57.</p>
<p>&#8220;I met Prince when I was 12 years old. I asked for his autograph&#8221;, Oseary posted. &#8220;He wrote &#8216;Love God'&#8221;</p>
<p>&#8220;Many many years later I connected back with Prince.. And we have remained friends.&#8221;, Guyd goes on.</p>
<p>&#8220;I called him a few years back with the idea of Madonna and Prince going on tour together. I pitched it to Madonna and within a second she said &#8220;I like it, we can call it the Royalty Tour&#8230; The Queen and The Prince&#8221;&#8230;. I love the way she thinks&#8230; When I told Prince the idea he said: &#8220;the world isn&#8217;t ready for this, it&#8217;s too big&#8221;.. I always felt like one day I would pull it off&#8221;.</p>
<p>&#8220;Madonna performed in St. Paul last year and Prince was generous enough to host us and perform for us after that show at his home Paisley Park. He didn&#8217;t go on stage until 3am, and per usual the show performance was mindblowing&#8221;.</p>
<p>The post <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com/madonna-and-prince-on-tour-together-the-world-is-not-ready-for-this-he-thought/20160421">Madonna and Prince on tour together! &#8220;The world is not ready for this&#8221;, he thought.</a> appeared first on <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com">Madonna news new album Rebel Heart</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
