		<description><![CDATA[<p>Talking with the crowd in Melbourne, Madonna apologised for Tears of A Clown, saying “I only had two days to [...]</p>
<p>The post <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com/madonna-on-tears-of-a-clown-im-gonna-do-it-better-next-time/20160312">Madonna on Tears of a Clown: &#8220;I&#8217;m gonna do it better next time&#8221;</a> appeared first on <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com">Madonna news new album Rebel Heart</a>.</p>
]]></description>
				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Talking with the crowd in Melbourne, Madonna apologised for Tears of A Clown, saying “I only had two days to rehearse — I’m gonna do it better next time, I promise.”</p>
<p>Maybe she was imprecise here and there, but the show was absolutely amazing! Probably the best setlist ever, or at least the most interesting. Pure art!</p>
<p>So, no need to apologise at all!</p>
<p>But we hope that it is true that she will do it again. And there is no doubt that it is going to be ever better, if possible!</p>
<p>Her dancer Coral Dolphin said on Instagram that it was just the debut, and Tears of a Clown is &#8220;coming soon again&#8221;.</p>
<p>The post <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com/madonna-on-tears-of-a-clown-im-gonna-do-it-better-next-time/20160312">Madonna on Tears of a Clown: &#8220;I&#8217;m gonna do it better next time&#8221;</a> appeared first on <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com">Madonna news new album Rebel Heart</a>.</p>
