				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>RUMOURS FROM SINGAPORE &#8211; A lot has been said about the censorship for Holy Water. But if what we heard &#8211; and it sounds accurate &#8211; is true, it is nothing compared to how the show in Singapore will be &#8220;changed&#8221;.</p>
<p>One of our readers &#8211; we won&#8217;t reveal his name &#8211; met a few people who are part of the team of Madonna&#8217;s Rebel Heart Tour, and he had the chance to talk with them about the upcoming show.</p>
<p>According to what they told him, the concert will start directly with Bitch I&#8217;m Madonna. So, Iconic won&#8217;t be performed.</p>
<p>As reported, Holy Water won&#8217;t be performed as well. And &#8211; another surprise &#8211; Devil Pray neither.</p>
<p>Anyway, Madonna should perform more acoustic songs.</p>
<p>Let&#8217;s wait and see. What do you think?</p>
